          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The <strong class="text-white">Milwaukee versus DeWalt</strong> question rarely has a wrong answer on tool quality — both are genuinely excellent and both are trusted across the trades. What differs is platform breadth, warranty length, and what your local supplier stocks and services.
